# Performance and Efficiency

- Minimize redundant I/O; cache expensive operations where sensible.
- For large loops, use generators or chunked processing; prefer Pandas vectorization over manual iteration.
- Never call network APIs synchronously in batch mode; use async or batching where appropriate.
